      "w": 170,
      "h": 9,
      "size": 18
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "VahakIN supports owners and Regional Transport Offices (RTOs) in monitoring vehicles declared Non-Use. Both device designs capture motion and geographic position on the vehicle. The website links that evidence to the declaration, owner explanations, and an independent review of any proposed tax assessment [1].",
