    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Target operation. Basic obtains its own location from NEO-6M. Plus will obtain its own location from a GNSS module fitted to the watch. Each unit samples, timestamps, buffers and uploads evidence through its own network interface. The target workflow requires no owner handset [1]\u2013[3].",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 203,
      "w": 184,
      "h": 29,
      "size": 12.7
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Build status \u00b7 Basic GNSS firmware is implemented. Plus IMU firmware is implemented and its GNSS/modem integration is planned.",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 233,
      "w": 184,
      "h": 11,
      "size": 10.6
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "03",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 248,
      "w": 12,
      "h": 9,
      "size": 17
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "GUJARAT NON-USE & TAX",
      "x": 26,
      "y": 248,
      "w": 170,
      "h": 9,
      "size": 18
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Form NT records the reason, period and garage address under Rule 5 [5]. Section 3(2) ties Non-Use recognition to certification by the Taxation Authority. The portal separates application review, certification status and movement requests [4], [5].",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 262,
      "w": 184,
      "h": 24,
      "size": 12.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The calculator selects a rule by vehicle class, jurisdiction and assessable period, then computes the estimate in whole paise. Distance and travel time inform the investigation. The notified schedule and applicable period determine the base tax [1], [4].",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 288,
      "w": 184,
      "h": 24,
      "size": 12.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "ILLUSTRATIVE TAX REVIEW  /  DEMO",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 317,
      "w": 176,
      "h": 6,
      "size": 10.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "INR 6,000 base + 12,000 penalty = 18,000",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 324,
      "w": 176,
      "h": 9,
      "size": 16
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Illustrative base and potential 2\u00d7 penalty under \u00a718(1A) [4].",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 333,
      "w": 176,
      "h": 5.5,
      "size": 10.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Section 18(1B) prevents stacking \u00a718(1) and \u00a718(1A) penalties. The demo requests an owner explanation before an independent decision. Official assessments require verified rates and an authorized Taxation Authority [1], [4].",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 344,
      "w": 184,
      "h": 25,
      "size": 12
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "04",
      "x": 205,
      "y": 82,
      "w": 12,
      "h": 9,
      "size": 17
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "MOTION CLASSIFICATION",
      "x": 219,
      "y": 82,
      "w": 170,
      "h": 9,
      "size": 18
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Sample at 50 Hz and calibrate for 5 s while still. In each 2 s window, require 75 of 100 samples at or above 0.12 g of dynamic acceleration or 12\u00b0/s of rotation. Re-arm after 5 s of quiet.",
      "x": 205,
      "y": 96,
      "w": 184,
      "h": 22,
      "size": 13.2
    },
    {
