      "y": 262,
      "w": 184,
      "h": 68.2
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Fig. 2. Simulated distance from the parking centre. A 150 m radius plus a 25 m buffer gives a 175 m exit threshold.",
      "x": 205,
      "y": 332,
      "w": 184,
      "h": 11,
      "size": 11
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "HOW RTO STAFF USE A SIGNAL",
      "x": 209,
      "y": 348,
      "w": 176,
      "h": 7,
      "size": 11.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Motion can come from handling. GNSS drift can place a stationary device near a boundary. Staff review the observations, permission record and owner explanation before deciding the case.",
      "x": 209,
      "y": 355,
      "w": 176,
      "h": 12,
